## The Persuasion Equation

**URGENT PROBLEM + UNIQUE PROMISE + UNQUESTIONABLE PROOF + USER-FRIENDLY PROPOSITION = IRRESISTIBLE OFFER**

This is the skeleton of every piece. Build it before you write a word.

| Element | What It Does | How to Execute |
|---|---|---|
| **Urgent Problem** | Makes reader feel the pain NOW | Name it explicitly. Amplify stakes. Tap existing fear or frustration. |
| **Unique Promise** | Differentiates the solution | One specific, measurable outcome. Not "better" — "23 lbs in 6 weeks." |
| **Unquestionable Proof** | Eliminates skepticism | Layer: testimonials → case histories → expert endorsements → statistics → credentials |
| **User-Friendly Proposition** | Removes action friction | Single clear next step. Risk reversal. Guarantee. Zero ambiguity. |

