## Fascinations

The most powerful bullets in direct response. Generate curiosity while delivering a specific benefit.

**Core Formula:** `[Specific Benefit] without [Feared Drawback]`

**Fascination Types:**

| Type | Formula | Example |
|---|---|---|
| How-to | "How to [outcome] without [sacrifice]" | "How to lower LDL cholesterol without statins" |
| Secret | "The [source]'s secret for [result]" | "The cardiologist's secret for reading blood panels" |
| Never | "Never [mistake] again" | "Never use this common supplement before surgery" |
| Why | "Why [counterintuitive truth]" | "Why eating more fat can shrink your waistline" |
| Number + Benefit | "[#] [experts/sources] [bold claim]" | "47 doctors call this the 'fatigue cure'" |
| Specific outcome | "The easiest way to [measurable result]" | "The easiest way to add $1,200/month in passive income" |
| Warning | "Warning: [trusted thing] may be [danger]" | "Warning: This popular sleep aid may be accelerating memory loss" |

**Generate 10–15 fascinations per section. The 12th will beat the 3rd every time.**

