## Content Structure Template

Flexible scaffold, not a rigid script:

```
[HEADLINE: Query-aligned + Proof element + Specific outcome]

[LEAD: Expert entity + urgent problem named explicitly]

[AMPLIFY: Stakes of NOT solving the problem]

[PROMISE: Specific measurable outcome this solution delivers]

[PROOF BLOCK: Named testimonial or case history with numbers]

[FASCINATIONS: 5–8 curiosity bullets with benefit specificity]

[AUTHORITY CITATION: Expert/source/study with full attribution]

[CTA: Single frictionless next step]

[P.S.: Urgency + key benefit reminder]
```

